    "kind": "document",
    "mechanicalProblem": {
      "type": "single_choice",
      "options": [
        "scanf(\"%d\", age);",
        "scanf(\"%f\", &age);",
        "scanf(\"%d\", &age);",
        "scanf(\"%s\", age);"
      ],
      "answers": [
        "2"
      ],
      "explanation": "scanf 的 %d 需要 int*，因此传入 &age。还应检查调用返回值以确认转换成功。",
